WEBVTT

00:02.259 --> 00:03.802
<i>Following high school graduation,</i>

00:03.886 --> 00:06.722
<i>Leone Abbacchio
turned to the police force.</i>

00:06.972 --> 00:10.517
<i>It was a pure, unadulterated
sense of justice.</i>

00:11.185 --> 00:14.188
<i>But the realization of
his long-held dream did nothing</i>

00:14.229 --> 00:16.314
<i>to quell the unease he felt
from the myriad contradictions</i>

00:16.398 --> 00:18.316
<i>plaguing his daily work.</i>

00:18.650 --> 00:22.028
<i>Every day, he risked his life
to serve and protect</i>

00:22.070 --> 00:26.115
<i>yet the very people
he was expected to defend,</i>

00:26.492 --> 00:28.785
<i>were the same people
who were cheating the police,</i>

00:28.869 --> 00:30.120
<i>stealing from the public,</i>

00:30.204 --> 00:32.247
<i>- committing felonies,</i>
- Hey, you two!

00:32.289 --> 00:35.041
<i>And destroying the property
of law enforcement.</i>

00:36.710 --> 00:37.961
Honey!

00:38.420 --> 00:39.587
Are you all right?

00:40.422 --> 00:41.548
Hey, you!

00:41.590 --> 00:43.258
You're a freakin' cop, aren't you?!

00:43.300 --> 00:44.759
<i>It was a thank less job</i>

00:44.843 --> 00:47.762
<i>and the demands never
seemed to stop</i>

00:47.763 --> 00:50.682
<i>nor did the insults
or verbal humiliations.</i>

00:51.266 --> 00:53.227
<i>He could imperil his life
to capture</i>

00:52.226 --> 00:54.186
SERIAL BURGLAR ISACCO ARRESTED

00:53.268 --> 00:55.687
<i>and put behind bars
the lowest of the low.</i>

00:54.937 --> 00:57.147
A WHOLE GROUP WIPED OUT

00:55.979 --> 00:59.149
<i>Yet the law meant little to nothing
in the presence of cash.</i>

00:58.023 --> 01:01.943
ISACCO RELEASED
ON SEVENTY MILLION LIRA
VICTIMS FURIOUS

00:59.191 --> 01:01.818
<i>Criminals were simply released.</i>

01:02.319 --> 01:03.987
Quit stirring up trouble.

01:04.071 --> 01:06.198
- Sorry.
- Doesn't matter much now.

01:06.532 --> 01:08.116
- The world's full of suckers, ya know.
<i>- The contradictions became</i>

01:08.158 --> 01:10.243
<i>a great teacher to Abbacchio.</i>

01:13.580 --> 01:15.498
Come on, Officer.

01:15.582 --> 01:17.542
Cut us some slack.

01:17.626 --> 01:20.754
That chick's pop is in debt
up to his eyeballs.

01:20.796 --> 01:22.672
She needs the cash real bad.

01:22.881 --> 01:24.924
We're just minding
our own business.

01:24.967 --> 01:26.635
You still here?

01:26.677 --> 01:28.178
I got a good customer here.

01:28.262 --> 01:29.513
You think I don't know…?

01:32.683 --> 01:35.018
<i>Even if I arrested these bastards,</i>

01:35.060 --> 01:37.645
<i>they'd just post bail
and walkaway</i>

01:37.896 --> 01:40.231
<i>They'll either try to pay me off,</i>

01:40.315 --> 01:42.859
<i>or throw cash at
the courts and lawyers.</i>

01:44.403 --> 01:47.447
You're a man of passion… aren't ya?

01:47.489 --> 01:50.825
You're a cop who takes
his job seriously.

01:55.122 --> 01:56.581
<i>Then, one night,</i>

01:56.665 --> 01:59.834
<i>- reports came in of a robbery</i>
- Abbacchio! Go around the back.

02:06.717 --> 02:08.218
Freeze! You're under arrest!

02:10.971 --> 02:14.182
H-Hey, so we meet again.

02:14.891 --> 02:17.810
- Guess I really screwed up this time.
- You're…

02:19.187 --> 02:21.480
Someone blew his brains out.

02:21.523 --> 02:24.442
You can just pretend
you never saw this, right?

02:24.526 --> 02:26.236
Come on,
it'll be our little secret.

02:26.320 --> 02:28.572
I'll never bother you again.

02:28.614 --> 02:29.948
In your dreams!
You're going to jail!

02:30.032 --> 02:32.826
Hey, I'd give it another thought…

02:32.993 --> 02:34.411
If you arrest me,

02:34.453 --> 02:38.248
everyone'll find out
you took a bribe.

02:39.082 --> 02:42.251
Now you know,
you shouldn't play with guns…

02:42.294 --> 02:44.629
You mind pointing
that thing somewhere else?

02:49.134 --> 02:51.594
Abbacchio! He's got a gun!

02:58.101 --> 03:01.104
Ow! It hurts so bad, ow… Shit!

03:01.188 --> 03:02.981
I'm dead…

03:03.440 --> 03:04.607
I'm through…

03:05.400 --> 03:06.567
I'm a goner…

03:06.693 --> 03:08.611
It's all over…

03:18.538 --> 03:21.832
<i>For Abbacchio, the moment marked
the beginning of the end.</i>

03:23.877 --> 03:27.964
<i>He was labeled a dirty cop
and punished accordingly.</i>

03:28.048 --> 03:29.215
<i>What was worse,</i>

03:29.257 --> 03:31.968
<i>he had lost his partner
because of his own actions</i>

03:32.010 --> 03:35.304
<i>a fact he would have to endure
for the rest of his life.</i>

03:35.555 --> 03:40.055
<i>He had arrived at a place
of deep depression.</i>

03:40.727 --> 03:42.478
<i>It didn't matter
whom death would visit,</i>

03:42.562 --> 03:44.897
<i>it didn't matter
if his body was mutilated</i>

03:45.232 --> 03:46.274
<i>It seemed nothing
would ever dislodge</i>

03:46.316 --> 03:47.400
<i>the grief
that entangled his heart.</i>

04:04.751 --> 04:07.170
Abbacchio, wasn't it?

04:25.021 --> 04:29.521
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

04:30.360 --> 04:33.863
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

04:35.615 --> 04:40.115
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

04:40.787 --> 04:44.624
<i>But I will never give in</i>

04:44.666 --> 04:49.166
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

04:56.470 --> 05:00.970
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

05:09.524 --> 05:14.024
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

05:15.530 --> 05:20.030
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

05:22.579 --> 05:25.748
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

05:25.791 --> 05:30.291
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

05:31.046 --> 05:35.546
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

05:45.352 --> 05:49.852
EPISODE 06
MOODY JAZZ'S COUNTERATTACK

05:54.945 --> 05:57.238
That mystery, you got it, right?

05:57.739 --> 05:58.740
Don't let me down now!

05:58.782 --> 05:59.783
Giorno!

05:59.908 --> 06:01.367
What are you doing?!

06:05.372 --> 06:06.623
ROAR

06:07.332 --> 06:09.000
G-Giorno!

06:10.043 --> 06:11.335
Giorno's in trouble!

06:12.879 --> 06:14.505
Giorno Giovanna…

06:14.589 --> 06:17.758
You're one deranged bastardo.

06:17.843 --> 06:19.636
You just had to prove yourself…

06:22.681 --> 06:25.183
You're a freakin' lunatic…

06:26.017 --> 06:27.977
Maledetto…

06:28.144 --> 06:30.187
Th-This Stand…

06:30.313 --> 06:32.815
Protect yourself with Golden Wind!

06:35.277 --> 06:36.611
For Christ's sake!

06:37.112 --> 06:39.405
Giorno… Where are you?!

06:40.031 --> 06:42.491
I want you to stay up here,
Bucciarati.

06:42.534 --> 06:44.494
In fact, stay back.

06:44.536 --> 06:46.079
You're crazy if you think

06:46.121 --> 06:48.957
I consider Giorno Giovanna
one of us.

06:48.999 --> 06:53.499
But apparently,
he thinks you've got his back.

06:55.088 --> 06:57.590
The guy's a complete wack job.

06:57.924 --> 06:59.842
Giorno Giovanna…

07:00.051 --> 07:03.387
That thing could've killed you.
Then what?

07:04.472 --> 07:07.683
Listen, Bucciarati,
don't go down there.

07:11.938 --> 07:14.357
Th-That fly…

07:14.816 --> 07:16.317
Narancia's shoe…

07:16.651 --> 07:18.861
Giorno's powers are still active.

07:19.112 --> 07:20.530
Giorno could still be alive…

07:20.572 --> 07:21.864
They're here, Bucciarati!

07:21.948 --> 07:23.866
Narancia and that bastard
are down there!

07:24.701 --> 07:26.953
Zipper Man!

07:33.835 --> 07:36.796
Narancia, Fugo, Mista,
and Giorno are gone!

07:36.838 --> 07:39.173
Could they be right under the fly…

07:39.215 --> 07:41.258
Giorno was exactly right.

07:41.343 --> 07:45.843
The enemy isn't simply hiding
in some locker or shadow…

07:46.890 --> 07:49.225
Look, the fly's coming back
this way.

07:50.352 --> 07:51.603
What the hell…

07:51.686 --> 07:53.354
Where is it going now?

07:53.521 --> 07:56.899
How could it hide like this,
where could it be?

07:56.983 --> 07:59.652
This enemy's abilities…

08:00.028 --> 08:01.487
I can't believe I'm saying this,

08:01.529 --> 08:04.532
but that showoff
managed to get it right.

08:04.741 --> 08:06.909
I'll expose this sonuvabitch
once and for all!

08:07.035 --> 08:10.246
But… We gotta jam now, Bucciarati!

08:18.880 --> 08:21.215
Moody Jazz!

08:26.805 --> 08:28.640
How about Narancia,
five minutes ago?

08:28.723 --> 08:30.766
Yeah, that should be more
than enough.

08:38.900 --> 08:40.192
What about that fly?

08:40.318 --> 08:42.528
It's heading toward the bow.

08:42.570 --> 08:45.072
We don't have much time.
Work fast.

08:45.115 --> 08:46.157
Yeah.

08:58.461 --> 08:59.962
What's that noise?

09:00.046 --> 09:01.422
His headphones.

09:01.464 --> 09:05.342
Five minutes ago,
Narancia was listening to music.

09:06.302 --> 09:09.138
Huh? What the freakin' hell?
Why won't this thing play?!

09:09.180 --> 09:10.723
- This isn't it.
- Why'd it stop?

09:10.765 --> 09:12.516
- I just bought the piece of crap!
- Narancia was attacked

09:12.559 --> 09:14.102
- Shit, he freakin'
- at a later time.

09:14.144 --> 09:15.436
- Sold me a lemon!
- I'll fast forward and see what I can find.

09:15.437 --> 09:17.981
That lowlife is gonna wish
he never lived!

09:25.530 --> 09:27.532
That ten billion now belongs to us!

09:27.741 --> 09:30.827
With that kind of capital,
we will achieve capo!

09:30.952 --> 09:32.370
A-Awesome!

09:32.454 --> 09:33.288
- That was my voice.
- Where is it?

09:33.288 --> 09:35.290
- That was my voice.
- Where'd you hide that kind of

09:35.331 --> 09:36.540
- It was right after this.
- money on Capri, Bucciarati?

09:36.583 --> 09:38.167
- That's when it got him!
- I can't tell you that yet.

09:38.501 --> 09:40.002
This'll better give us
a clear picture

09:40.045 --> 09:42.047
of his moment of attack, Abbacchio.

09:42.130 --> 09:45.341
My Stand can replay
anything it records.

09:45.425 --> 09:47.009
We'll be able to
observe everything,

09:47.093 --> 09:49.178
from his heart rate to
the perspiration on his skin.

09:49.637 --> 09:51.847
And it'll follow him
wherever he goes.

09:51.931 --> 09:53.265
The time has come.

09:55.685 --> 09:57.395
Get behind Narancia.

09:57.479 --> 09:58.771
It's going to get him now!

10:00.023 --> 10:02.775
L-Look! Giorno had the same gash!

10:03.026 --> 10:04.402
ROAR

10:04.444 --> 10:05.445
It's here!

10:06.905 --> 10:08.698
Th-This is…

10:12.243 --> 10:15.871
It's like he's a popped balloon…
He's shriveling up into nothing!

10:25.006 --> 10:27.091
MARIO ZUCCHERO
TENDER MACHINE

10:31.805 --> 10:34.474
His wound is releasing air,
making his body deflate.

10:34.808 --> 10:37.852
Looks like we got the scoop
on this cazzo's abilities.

10:39.020 --> 10:40.604
Something's pulling him in now!

10:40.688 --> 10:42.398
Pause it, Abbacchio!

10:48.196 --> 10:51.240
I see… So he's inside the pipe.

10:51.616 --> 10:53.242
The answer to all this might
be right here.

10:53.743 --> 10:57.955
His nails and bones, everything is
rubbery like a condom…

10:58.039 --> 11:00.541
Even his shoe and buckle.

11:00.708 --> 11:02.876
Yet I still feel a pulse.

11:03.044 --> 11:06.005
It's as Giorno said, he's alive.

11:06.548 --> 11:08.258
That explains it then…

11:08.341 --> 11:11.552
So our enemy has rubberized
his own body too.

11:11.553 --> 11:14.264
He hides in pipes,
in between plank, in walls…

11:14.305 --> 11:17.766
That's how he's captured Mista,
Fugo, and Giorno.

11:18.434 --> 11:20.352
That's why Giorno's fly
can make out

11:20.395 --> 11:22.146
the enemy's general whereabouts,

11:22.230 --> 11:25.775
but can't pinpoint
its precise location.

11:26.067 --> 11:28.778
So we exposed the enemy's secret.

11:28.862 --> 11:30.864
Now all we have to do is track down
that wannabe condom

11:30.905 --> 11:33.782
rescue Narancia and the others

11:34.117 --> 11:36.410
and then deliver
one helluva beat down.

11:36.536 --> 11:39.413
Get ready for more Moody Jazz.

11:41.749 --> 11:44.251
Track down? Hold it, Abbacchio!

11:44.294 --> 11:47.630
During replay, you can't attack
or defend. It's too risky!

11:47.714 --> 11:49.716
You're asking for it
if you go in there.

11:49.757 --> 11:52.718
I know the precise
movement and location

11:52.760 --> 11:54.136
of Moody Jazz at all times.

11:54.596 --> 11:56.014
When that bastard gets close,

11:56.097 --> 11:58.766
unzip the floor and beat
his ass to kingdom come!

11:59.100 --> 12:00.726
We can't defeat this guy
sitting here

12:00.768 --> 12:02.728
twiddling our thumbs, Bucciarati!

12:08.401 --> 12:09.819
It went left.

12:09.944 --> 12:11.612
That's where he got Mista.

12:11.654 --> 12:15.199
Moody Jazz is passing underneath
the buoy right now.

12:15.283 --> 12:17.618
Now it's taking a detour
to the cabin

12:17.660 --> 12:19.745
where it got Fugo and Giorno.

12:19.954 --> 12:21.747
So the enemy is able to
hold them captive

12:21.789 --> 12:23.749
and move them
exactly where he wants.

12:23.791 --> 12:26.335
He's slowing down…

12:26.377 --> 12:28.545
That's where he was hiding before.

12:28.963 --> 12:30.839
On the inside of that rope tie!

12:30.882 --> 12:33.551
He's directly below the deck!

12:34.969 --> 12:36.720
That shifty bastard's
coming this way.

12:36.804 --> 12:39.556
He might know that we uncovered
his secret of attack…

12:39.974 --> 12:41.350
Then he's got balls!

12:41.392 --> 12:43.852
The pipes! Cut 'em open
and pull our boys out!

12:44.062 --> 12:45.980
Zipper Man!

12:48.566 --> 12:50.025
I don't see them!

12:50.652 --> 12:52.278
Where's our target, Abbacchio?

12:52.570 --> 12:55.364
Where's Moody Jazz?
Where are they?

12:56.074 --> 12:57.200
Right there.

12:57.659 --> 13:00.703
It's my Stand. I know where it is.

13:00.745 --> 13:02.037
It's right over there.

13:02.080 --> 13:03.414
Right over where?

13:03.456 --> 13:05.040
Jesus, right where
you opened the zipper!

13:05.208 --> 13:08.127
Moody Jazz is there,
I know it!

13:15.426 --> 13:16.427
Where are they?

13:16.511 --> 13:17.512
What happened?

13:18.012 --> 13:21.765
<i>There's no way…
He's right there.</i>

13:22.016 --> 13:25.102
<i>Is there some other mystery
we still haven't figured out?</i>

13:25.228 --> 13:26.229
Porca miseria!

13:26.271 --> 13:28.064
Stop the replay and summon back
your Stand!

13:28.147 --> 13:29.565
I've already stopped it.

13:30.525 --> 13:31.817
<i>Something's wrong…</i>

13:32.527 --> 13:35.112
<i>I'm not recognizing this wall.</i>

13:35.196 --> 13:38.657
<i>Which crack did you crawl into now?</i>

13:42.704 --> 13:44.247
Hear that, Bucciarati?

13:44.330 --> 13:46.248
That's the pipe wall.

13:46.374 --> 13:50.503
You can't see him, but Moody Jazz
is right under our noses…

13:50.545 --> 13:52.588
- Right inside the pipe.
- What are you doing?

13:52.630 --> 13:54.506
- The enemy's right there!
- The pipe's open for the world to see,

13:54.549 --> 13:56.217
but nothing's there…

13:56.259 --> 13:57.927
- He's closing in…
- So he is right here…

13:57.969 --> 13:59.345
Quick, we need to
get out of here!

14:00.555 --> 14:01.973
You wanna run?

14:02.974 --> 14:05.476
To think, Giorno Giovanna,
that grating do-gooder,

14:05.560 --> 14:08.187
told me to solve
this entire dammed mystery.

14:08.229 --> 14:10.105
Disrespectful punk…

14:10.231 --> 14:11.607
You're lucky I'm nice!

14:11.691 --> 14:12.983
Abbacchio…

14:17.447 --> 14:18.614
It's coming!

14:19.866 --> 14:22.034
There's one more mystery to solve.

14:22.076 --> 14:24.119
…and I think I've just about
cracked the case.

14:24.203 --> 14:26.038
…and then, I'll crack open
this cazzo's skull!

14:26.331 --> 14:28.291
<i>There was something
about that mast…</i>

14:28.916 --> 14:30.000
<i>Something was off..</i>

14:30.835 --> 14:35.335
BZZZ ZZZ ZZZ

14:31.002 --> 14:32.962
The enemy's here…
Withdraw your Stand!

14:33.004 --> 14:36.820
It all makes sense…
I solved our mystery, men!

14:49.604 --> 14:50.980
Abbacchio…

14:51.272 --> 14:53.899
Time for the coup de grace…
Bucciarati!

14:53.983 --> 14:55.985
That's a pretty impressive trick…

14:56.110 --> 14:58.320
and a pretty impressive hide out…

14:58.363 --> 15:00.907
He's got you too now!
Grab on to me!

15:04.869 --> 15:05.870
Damn it!

15:05.953 --> 15:07.496
He's gone…

15:08.039 --> 15:09.206
Where did he go?

15:18.132 --> 15:19.174
What?

15:25.431 --> 15:27.558
Stronzo, where the hell…?

15:28.017 --> 15:30.561
What'd you do with Abbacchio?!

15:42.323 --> 15:44.992
He's not in the cabin,
and he's not in the pipe…

15:44.992 --> 15:48.787
What did you do to Abbacchio?
What did you do to my famiglia?!

15:55.128 --> 15:57.839
Surely you see
the seagulls flying above…

16:01.634 --> 16:04.803
I suppose we are finally
approaching land.

16:05.513 --> 16:09.225
Looks like I finally have you
to myself, Bucciarati.

16:10.226 --> 16:13.395
- You bas—
- Oh, aspetta, aspetta.

16:13.438 --> 16:15.356
Ah, ah, ah!

16:15.523 --> 16:18.400
I'm the one talking here.

16:18.526 --> 16:20.361
Now you'll keep that mouth shut

16:20.403 --> 16:23.155
until I'll tell you to open it,
test a di cazzo!

16:26.200 --> 16:27.743
That's it.

16:29.036 --> 16:33.165
Know that I can eliminate you
at any moment.

16:33.207 --> 16:35.959
I choose to let
your little minions live.

16:36.043 --> 16:37.753
I've kept them in
a state of suspended animation.

16:37.837 --> 16:39.755
You should be more appreciative.

16:39.839 --> 16:42.591
I could've slaughtered them and
thrown them to the fishes below.

16:42.633 --> 16:44.718
They would have to be
nice bite-sized pieces.

16:44.760 --> 16:46.887
Wouldn't want the little fishies
to strain themselves.

16:47.180 --> 16:48.931
If you decide to cooperate,
however,

16:49.015 --> 16:52.268
I could return your crew
back to normal.

16:52.351 --> 16:54.811
Of course, you would need to
tell me where Polpo

16:54.896 --> 16:57.440
has been hiding
that wonderful treasure of his!

17:00.485 --> 17:03.362
Are you a member of Passione?

17:04.238 --> 17:06.490
You really…

17:06.574 --> 17:09.118
…just don't get it.

17:11.037 --> 17:13.456
I'll kill you, cazzo… mezza sega!

17:13.539 --> 17:15.165
Listen up! The only thing
I want to hear out of your mouth

17:15.249 --> 17:16.792
is the location of the loot!

17:16.918 --> 17:18.628
Go ahead and try
to shit out anything else

17:18.753 --> 17:22.548
from that disgusting bunghole
slapped across your face!

17:22.590 --> 17:24.967
For every word you misspeak,
I'll murder one of your pals!

17:25.051 --> 17:27.136
If you so much as grunt a huh,
I'll take a life!

17:27.136 --> 17:28.262
Say nothing, and I'll kill 'em!

17:28.513 --> 17:31.641
If I find out you fibbed,
I'll kill 'em!

17:37.313 --> 17:38.522
Capito?

17:38.606 --> 17:42.359
Choose your words
extremely carefully.

17:42.610 --> 17:45.321
Now, it is time for the question…

17:45.404 --> 17:49.616
Where can I find that money?

17:55.039 --> 17:56.290
The black tailed gull.

17:58.209 --> 17:59.793
Huh, come again?

17:59.835 --> 18:02.003
Those aren't seagulls.

18:02.296 --> 18:03.672
They're black-tailed gulls.

18:03.714 --> 18:06.007
You may wonder how I can tell.

18:06.092 --> 18:08.552
Of course, the one's meowing
are the black-tailed gulls.

18:08.636 --> 18:11.013
You had mentioned
they were seagulls

18:11.055 --> 18:12.848
but they were really
black-tailed gulls.

18:17.520 --> 18:18.938
Say good bye to your comrade!

18:18.980 --> 18:19.897
Try it, jerk off…

18:19.981 --> 18:21.899
That is, if you don't get dragged
into the pits of hell first!

18:25.653 --> 18:28.322
W-What the hell are you doing?!

18:36.872 --> 18:41.042
I didn't strike the deck
to find Abbacchio.

18:41.335 --> 18:43.211
I just wanted to create a little
leak at the bottom of the boat.

18:43.296 --> 18:44.797
A leak?!

18:44.839 --> 18:49.260
Abbacchio unraveled the mystery
of your special hiding spot

18:49.343 --> 18:52.179
and he was nice enough to leave
a bit of evidence in passing…

18:52.221 --> 18:56.266
evidence of your location and
your distinguishing features.

18:56.392 --> 18:58.060
It was Abbacchio's blood.

18:58.102 --> 19:00.896
Abbacchio injured his own hand,

19:00.938 --> 19:03.273
so as to leave behind
a trail of blood.

19:03.357 --> 19:06.443
The blood never seeped
below the deck!

19:06.819 --> 19:11.031
It just stops… Interestingly,
right at the floorboards!

19:11.073 --> 19:12.657
There has to be a logical answer…

19:12.700 --> 19:14.576
He had to have been
dragged somewhere.

19:16.037 --> 19:18.414
I rented the yacht
that was on the left.

19:18.831 --> 19:22.000
Abbacchio realized that when
he looked up at the sky.

19:22.293 --> 19:23.961
Your cover's been blown.

19:24.045 --> 19:26.172
If you'd prefer to avoid death
by drowning,

19:26.213 --> 19:27.797
I'd come on out.

19:38.517 --> 19:40.268
There were two boats!

19:40.394 --> 19:42.312
BWAAAA

19:49.278 --> 19:51.113
You bastard…

19:55.409 --> 19:57.661
You hid yourself by stretching

19:57.745 --> 20:00.164
one yacht over another
like a thin skin.

20:00.956 --> 20:03.917
You moved about within the slim
space created between them,

20:03.959 --> 20:06.419
ambushing us as you pleased.

20:06.671 --> 20:10.299
You crafted quite the conundrum.
Complimenti.

20:10.341 --> 20:12.801
I'd stay right
where you are, Bucciarati!

20:13.761 --> 20:15.637
I'll destroy
your precious companions!

20:15.680 --> 20:17.973
You of all people should know…

20:18.015 --> 20:19.808
you wouldn't last
one day as a mafioso

20:19.850 --> 20:21.768
if a pathetic threat like that
rattles your bones.

20:22.228 --> 20:24.271
Stop this nonsense,
and I'll have mercy on you.

20:24.313 --> 20:26.773
But the moment you stab Abbacchio…

20:27.358 --> 20:29.318
I will put an end to your life.

20:43.332 --> 20:44.082
FWIP

20:47.962 --> 20:49.838
It's just as Giorno said.

20:49.922 --> 20:53.425
Your need to remain hidden while
attacking is a point of weakness.

20:54.260 --> 20:56.011
You really need some speed.

20:56.595 --> 20:58.847
POP

21:09.692 --> 21:10.859
Abbacchio!

21:16.490 --> 21:18.366
Bravo, bravo…

22:52.920 --> 22:54.129
<i>Abbacchio</i>

22:54.672 --> 22:57.049
<i>the end result
isn't what matters most.</i>

22:57.132 --> 22:59.300
<i>It's everything that got you there.</i>

23:03.931 --> 23:05.557
<i>Come join us.</i>

23:06.475 --> 23:08.643
<i>Don't live out the rest of
your life stuck in the past.</i>

23:37.882 --> 23:41.594
EPISODE 07
SIX BULLETS APPEARS, PART 1
